abstract: "Reproducibility package associated with Projects Lattice and Forge. Includes explicit singleton-interaction triangle certificates for 13,638,755 fixed three-row replacement neighborhoods in two existing covering arrays, and a separate checker. AI-assisted computational research; independently adjudicated by Project Forge (Muse), 2026-11-26."
